cture Associates Program Info Session Thu, Oct 29 from 2pm - 3pm Thursday, October 29th from 2pm - 3pm See more events APPLY FOR INTERNSHIPS ATTEND EVENTS & WORKSHOPS LEARN TO USE HANDSHAKE PREPARE FOR INTERVIEWS COMPLETE AN INTERNSHIP WRITE A RESUME & COVER LETTER Employers Hiring Now Toggle animation View All Latest News How to Format a Resume with Freelance Work Share This: Share How to Format a Resume with Freelance Work on Facebook Share How to Format a Resume with Freelance Work on LinkedIn Share How to Format a Resume with Freelance Work on X Copy Link Whether you’ve spent years working independently or you’ve taken on side projects to grow your skills, freelance experience can be a powerful addition to your resume. It shows you’re self-disciplined, versatile, and experienced. Properly highlighting this type of work can  … The Muse Show author info A smarter way to find a job facebook instagram linkedin tiktok twitter Read more » Tailoring Your CV to Each Job: The Key to Landing More Interviews Share This: Share Tailoring Your CV to Each Job: The Key to Landing More Interviews on Facebook Share Tailoring Your CV to Each Job: The Key to Landing More Interviews on LinkedIn Share Tailoring Your CV to Each Job: The Key to Landing More Interviews on X Copy Link You’ve just found a job that seems ideal for you. Excited you sent off your usual CV; hoping to hear back soon. But days go by, and nothing happens. No email, no call, no interview. This is a common experience  … By Ivy Exec Show author info Ivy Exec is your dedicated career development resource. facebook instagram linkedin twitter Read more » 15 Soft Skills Every Leader Should Master Share This: Share 15 Soft Skills Every Leader Should Master on Facebook Share 15 Soft Skills Every Leader Should Master on LinkedIn Share 15 Soft Skills Every Leader Should Master on X Copy Link While business strategy and technical expertise are important, they’re not what make a leader truly great. The best leaders don’t just manage teams—they inspire, communicate, and build a work environment where people feel valued and trusted. That’s where leadership soft  … The Muse Show author info A smarter way to find a job facebook instagram linkedin tiktok twitter Read more » What Not to Say in a Thank-you Email After an Interview Share This: Share What Not to Say in a Thank-you Email After an Interview on Facebook Share What Not to Say in a Thank-you Email After an Interview on LinkedIn Share What Not to Say in a Thank-you Email After an Interview on X Copy Link You know that sending a thank-you email after an interview is a must. But while following up with a note of appreciation can help you stand out, sending a bad post-interview thank-you email can actually do more harm than good.  … The Muse Show author info A smarter way to find a job facebook instagram linkedin tiktok twitter Read more » 3 ways to rock your next phone interview and land your dream job | From Dorms to Desks Podcast | ep29 Share This: Share 3 ways to rock your next phone interview and land your dream job | From Dorms to Desks Podcast | ep29 on Facebook Share 3 ways to rock your next phone interview and land your dream job | From Dorms to Desks Podcast | ep29 on LinkedIn Share 3 ways to rock your next phone interview and land your dream job | From Dorms to Desks Podcast | ep29 on X Copy Link In today’s episode of the From Dorms to Desks Podcast , our cohosts draw on some wisdom from career expert Bethany Wallace to talk about the importance of phone interviews and provide students, recent graduates, and others early in their careers with three  … By College Recruiter Show author info College Recruiter believes that every student and recent grad deserves a great career. facebook linkedin youtube Read more » 5 steps to success for your first 5 days on Handshake Share This: Share 5 steps to success for your first 5 days on Handshake on Facebook Share 5 steps to success for your first 5 days on Handshake on LinkedIn Share 5 steps to success for your first 5 days on Handshake on X Copy Link You signed up for Handshake—congratulations! You’re on your way to finding a great job or internship. To help you get started, we’ve outlined five steps to take during your first five days on Handshake. Read below for tips that will  … By Drew Georges Show author info Drew Georges Associate Director Send Email Read more » View All Blogs Sidebar Search CareerEdge Search Keywords Customize Your Alerts! Click here to peronsalize your alerts for career opportunities, events, advice, and more! Sign Up Featured Video Bienvenidos Familias Video post ! Bienvenidos a Mercy University! View All Videos Candid Career Videos Associate Director of Alumni Relations, Smeal College of Business Video post National Security Staff, Director of China and Korea Video post EVP and Global Leader, Recruiting,  DHR International Video post Associate Creative Director, WC+A Video post Assistant Project Manager, Hunt Construction Group Video post Professional Speaker and Author Video post View All Videos Featured Jobs Commonfund/CF Private Equity View All Jobs Brooklyn Navy Yard Development Corporation View All Jobs New York Life Insurance Company View All Jobs Lloyd Staffing View All Jobs HSBC Bank View All Jobs See All Jobs Career Coaches Dr. Kafui Kouakou Meet Dr. Kafui Lyn Leis Director, Career Education Meet Lyn Sara Shepherd (Employer Relations) Director, Employer Relations Meet Sara Gaylen Ronde (Employer Relations) Associate Director, Employer Relations Meet Gaylen Mariana Ayerbe Deputy Director, Career Education Meet Mariana Samantha Karpiloff Associate Director Meet Samantha Sharon Okaine Assistant Director Meet Sharon Shakeisha Ravenell Associate Director Meet Shakeisha Matt Walz Career Counselor Meet Matthew Featured Jobs Commonfund/CF Private Equity View All Jobs Brooklyn Navy Yard Development Corporation View All Jobs New York Life Insurance Company View All Jobs Lloyd Staffing View All Jobs HSBC Bank View All Job