istant Professor of Management and Interim Associate Dean for 2026–2027. The Interim Associate Dean assignment is a twelve-month administrative appointment. The faculty role carries a standard 4/4 teaching load, with course release and a stipend provided in recognition of the additional administrative responsibilities. Read more Adjunct Faculty Business 492333 New York, United States School of Business Adjunct Faculty Part Time The School of Business at Mercy University invites applicants for adjunct faculty positions to teach undergraduate and/or graduate Business classes. We seek candidates who demonstrate a commitment to student-centered teaching and can support students from diverse backgrounds. Read more Executive Director, Academic Success and Accessibility (A00736) 492652 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States Provost's Office Staff Faculty Full-time Staff Full-time The Executive Director for Academic Success and Accessibility serves as a senior academic leader responsible for advancing an integrated, student-centered model of academic support and accessibility services across Mercy. Reporting to the Senior Vice Provost for Academic Affairs, the Executive Director provides strategic leadership for accessibility services, tutoring, learning support initiatives, early alert interventions, and student success programs designed to improve retention, persistence, academic achievement, and degree completion. Read more Dean, College of Liberal Arts, Social and Behavioral Sciences, Education, Mathematics and Computer Sciences- A00741 492663 New York, United States Provost's Office Faculty Management Staff Faculty Full-time Staff Full-time Mercy University invites nominations and applications for the position of Dean of a newly established College (name to be determined) that brings together the liberal arts, social and behavioral sciences, education, mathematics, and computer sciences in a unified academic home dedicated to interdisciplinary learning, academic exce