 to join our adjunct faculty. This position will be primarily located at the Mercy University Dobbs Ferry campus and the instructor will be responsible for teaching one or more in-person sections of Anatomy and Physiology lab and/or lectures.  We welcome applications from candidates with strong organizational, interpersonal and communication skills, and the ability to work effectively in a dynamic team environment. Candidates must have a commitment to working in a multicultural setting. Read more Adjunct Faculty - General Biology 492325 New York, United States School of Health & Natural Sciences Adjunct Faculty Part Time The School of Health and Natural Sciences at Mercy University is seeking passionate, dedicated and experienced General Biology I and/or General Biology II Lecture instructors to join our adjunct faculty.\n\nThis position will be primarily located at the Dobbs Ferry campus and the instructor will be responsible for teaching one or more sections of General Biology I and/or General Biology II Lecture (fully in-person).  Multiple sections of General Biology are available. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Occupational Therapy 492319 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States School of Health & Natural Sciences Adjunct Faculty Part Time The School of Health and Natural Sciences at Mercy University invites qualified candidates for an adjunct professor position in the Occupational Therapy program. This position involves preparing and delivering lectures, developing course materials, assessing student performance, and providing academic support in areas related to delivery of occupational therapy services across a multitude of practice settings. The adjunct professor will collaborate with department faculty, participate in student advising, and maintain expertise in the field to ensure up-to-date instruction. Read more Adjunct Faculty (Lecture/Lab), Nursing 492290 Bronx, New York, United States Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States New York, United States School of Nursing Adjunct Faculty Part Time Mercy University is seeking applicants for teaching opportunities in the undergraduate and graduate nursing programs at our Bronx and Dobbs Ferry campuses. These positions require the ability to teach courses in the undergraduate or graduate programs. Read more Adjunct Faculty (Clinical), Nursing 492289 Bronx, New York, United States Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States New York, United States School of Nursing Adjunct Faculty Part Time Mercy University is seeking applicants for clinical teaching opportunities in Nursing at our Bronx and Dobbs Ferry campuses. Read more Adjunct Faculty- Accounting 492288 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States School of Business Adjunct Faculty Part Time The Accounting Department in the School of Business at Mercy College seeks part-time, adjunct instructors to teach a variety of accounting courses, including Advanced Accounting and Auditing to both undergraduate and graduate students, starting with the Spring 2026 semester. Candidates must be available and able to teach in various modalities (in-person and online).\n\nSuccessful candidates may be offered the opportunity to teach up to two sections of any given course, with an emphasis on taxation, introduction to financial and managerial accounting, and intermediate accounting with a maximum of three course assignments per semester. Commitment to teaching with inclusive excellence is required.\n\nCandidates may also be asked to assist with program curricular and professional activities and to attend select programmatic or professional development meetings. Read more Adjunct Faculty- School of Education Department of Early Childhood and Childhood Education 492492 New York, United States School of Education Adjunct Faculty Part Time Mercy University's School of Education Department of Early Childhood and Childhood Education is looking for qualified adjunct faculty members who can teach foundational and method courses in the Undergraduate Program Early Childhood and Childhood Education - STEM Concentration. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Chemistry 492322 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States School of Health & Natural Sciences Adjunct Faculty Part Time The School of Health and Natural Sciences at Mercy University is seeking passionate, dedicated, and experienced Chemistry instructors. Course openings include General Chemistry I & II, Organic Chemistry I & II, and Biochemistry lecture and laboratories. A Ph.D. in Chemistry or a related discipline, preferred; M.S. in Chemistry or a related discipline, required.\n\nCandidates with a record of excellent teaching at the undergraduate level are strongly preferred. We welcome applications from candidates with strong organizational, interpersonal and communication skills, and the ability to work effectively in a dynamic team environment. Candidates must have a commitment to working in a multicultural setting. Mercy University is a nonsectarian, nonprofit New York metropolitan area institution offering over 90 undergraduate and graduate programs. The University has an enrollment of approximately 9000 students from diverse backgrounds across four campuses in Westchester County and New York City.\n\nReview of applications will begin immediately and continue until the position is filled. Electronic applications are required and must include a cover letter, CV, and the names and contact information for at least three references. Read more Adjunct Faculty Foreign Language - Spanish 492418 Dobbs Ferry, NY, New York, United States School of Liberal Arts Adjunct Faculty Part Time The Modern Foreign Languages Program at Mercy University seeks part time, adjunct instructors to teach Spanish to undergraduate students. Successful candidates may be offered the opportunity to teach up to 3 section(s) per semester. Candidates may also be asked to provide assistance with program assessment and development and to attend select programmatic or professional development meetings. Re